# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the two values from your Supabase
# project: Dashboard → Project Settings → API.
#
# Leave them blank (or delete .env.local) and the app runs entirely in the
# browser with sample data — useful for trying things out, but each visitor gets
# their own private copy, so it is not a shared register.
#
# Both are safe in a browser. The anon key is designed to be public; what
# protects the data is row-level security in the database (supabase/schema.sql).
# NEVER put the `service_role` key in here — it bypasses every policy.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
